Z||000000||86SE||04-25-2000||06:46 PM||||I just replaced my ignition module and coil.  Now the engine stutters/stumbles, about 70% during acceleration and all the time when its just sitting in gear and only sometimes when its idleing.<P>It seems to do this in only the lower RPM range, once it gets above 2734 RPM it quits and runs perfectly normal.<P>If you take off 1-2 sparkplug wires it has the same effect on how the engine sounds and drives, but only it gets better above 2734 RPM.<P>When it stumbles I dont have anywhere near as good acceleration as I have when it dosent, oh yeah its an auto.<P>||||reg||8
Z||000001||87GT||04-25-2000||08:06 PM||||My fiero did the same thing and I was told to unplug the tach filter.  I did and it worked, the stuttering stopped.  I plugged the filter back in a week later and it fixed itself. odd huh?||||reg||1
Z||000002||86SE||04-25-2000||11:28 PM||||My tach has been jumpy.....I guess its probibly going bad, thanks!!||||reg||3
